WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.383 --> 00:00:14.683
flew toward Gildong.

2
00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:19.945
He waved his fan, and the arrows fell to the ground.

3
00:00:19.965 --> 00:00:23.706
"Fire again!"

4
00:00:24.186 --> 00:00:24.886
Heup cried.

5
00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:28.147
"Don't bother," Gildong said.

6
00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.748
"I am more powerful than anyone here.

7
00:00:31.316 --> 00:00:32.597
And I did not come to fight.

8
00:00:33.678 --> 00:00:38.302
I came as Your Majesty's loyal servant."

9
00:00:38.422 --> 00:00:40.384
"Loyal?" the king shouted.

10
00:00:40.404 --> 00:00:43.826
"You're nothing but a lowborn criminal!"

11
00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:47.109
"Yes, I am lowborn.

12
00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.532
But I serve Your Majesty and help the kingdom.

13
00:00:51.973 --> 00:00:54.415
The Hwalbindang punish greedy nobles and officials.

14
00:00:55.456 --> 00:00:57.257
We feed the hungry and help the poor.

15
00:00:58.578 --> 00:01:01.560
And so, as your loyal servant, I have a request."

16
00:01:03.241 --> 00:01:05.061
The king glared at Gildong.

17
00:01:06.202 --> 00:01:06.922
"What is it?"

18
00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:11.503
"Lord Hong has also served the kingdom loyally for many years.

19
00:01:12.203 --> 00:01:16.064
As you saw Gildong closed his eyes for a moment.

20
00:01:17.304 --> 00:01:19.205
"He is already unwell because of me.

21
00:01:21.025 --> 00:01:23.046
He should not be punished further for my deeds.

22
00:01:24.706 --> 00:01:26.947
I ask Your Majesty to free him from prison."

23
00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.368
The king thought for a moment.

24
00:01:32.232 --> 00:01:33.333
Then he sighed.

25
00:01:33.353 --> 00:01:37.358
"Fine. I'll release Lord Hong."

26
00:01:41.923 --> 00:01:44.786
Gildong floated down to the ground and bowed.

27
00:01:44.806 --> 00:01:48.430
"Thank you, Your Majesty."

28
00:01:49.912 --> 00:01:53.476
Poof! The last Gildong turned to straw.

29
00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:03.011
The real Gildong was alone at the hideout, thinking.

30
00:02:03.031 --> 00:02:06.073
"Lord Hong is free now.

31
00:02:06.874 --> 00:02:07.995
But I put him in danger.

32
00:02:09.155 --> 00:02:10.737
And I've caused him so much heartache.

33
00:02:11.677 --> 00:02:13.178
How can I ever face him again?"

34
00:02:17.982 --> 00:02:20.164
That night Gildong had a dream.

35
00:02:23.526 --> 00:02:25.208
He was in the land of the gods.

36
00:02:29.948 --> 00:02:32.010
Lord Hong stepped out of the mist.

37
00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:36.973
"I'm sorry, Your Lordship," Gildong said.

38
00:02:36.993 --> 00:02:39.395
"No, my son.

39
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:42.037
I am sorry," Lord Hong said.

40
00:02:42.057 --> 00:02:48.261
"I wish I had said this sooner—you may call me Father."

41
00:02:53.165 --> 00:02:57.208
In the morning, Gildong woke up and burst outside.

42
00:02:59.896 --> 00:03:01.017
Mok rushed over.

43
00:03:01.037 --> 00:03:03.177
"What's wrong?"

44
00:03:04.058 --> 00:03:05.879
"I must see my father right now!"

45
00:03:06.599 --> 00:03:08.280
Gildong opened his fan.

46
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:25.527
"Home!" But when he arrived, he was too late.

47
00:03:26.747 --> 00:03:27.968
His father was dead.

48
00:03:30.584 --> 00:03:32.366
Gildong sank to his knees.

49
00:03:32.386 --> 00:03:35.348
"Farewell, Father."

50
00:03:40.573 --> 00:03:43.856
As time passed, Gildong thought of his father often.

51
00:03:50.822 --> 00:03:54.005
Meanwhile the Hwalbindang continued their work.

52
00:03:55.286 --> 00:03:56.928
They were more popular than ever.

53
00:03:58.652 --> 00:04:00.893
This made the king very angry.

54
00:04:00.913 --> 00:04:06.836
"I shouldn't have let Gildong go," the king roared.

55
00:04:06.856 --> 00:04:12.458
"I've thought of a new way to trap him," Heup said.

56
00:04:12.478 --> 00:04:15.399
"You can make Gildong a high official.

57
00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.761
That lowborn boy cannot refuse your order.

58
00:04:20.362 --> 00:04:22.382
And he will be forced to return here."

59
00:04:27.016 --> 00:04:28.698
"Hmm." The king stroked his beard.

60
00:04:28.718 --> 00:04:31.321
"Clever idea.

61
00:04:32.903 --> 00:04:35.125
Put up signs around the land.

62
00:04:36.106 --> 00:04:39.770
Announce that Gildong is my new minister of war.

63
00:04:40.691 --> 00:04:43.855
And then we will get him for sure!"
